# DeployMate Studio — Environment File Locations
#
# Each component keeps its own .env (git-ignored) with its own .env.example:
#
#   backend/.env    -> BACKEND_PORT, FRONTEND_ORIGIN, AI_ENGINE_URL, MONGODB_URI,
#                      JWT_SECRET, JWT_EXPIRES_IN, GITHUB_CLIENT_ID/SECRET,
#                      GITHUB_CALLBACK_URL, DEV_DEMO_MODE
#   frontend/.env   -> VITE_API_URL, VITE_WS_URL (both optional — defaults to
#                      same-origin /api and ws(s)://<host>/ws)
#   ai-engine/.env  -> GEMINI_API_KEY, GROQ_API_KEY, LLM_PROVIDER, GITHUB_TOKEN, USE_LLM
#
# Quick start (Docker):
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   cp ai-engine/.env.example ai-engine/.env
#   docker compose up --build
#
# Or run each component locally — see README.md.
